  "html": "<p>謝謝所有參與活動的師長、校友與新生，讓 EMRD / SEMI-EMRD 第一屆新生破冰營活動進行地順利圓滿！也預祝 112 級學長姐未來的學習生活豐富充實！</p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/h-VzMZj0icM\" title=\"112/08/13 第一屆 112 新生破冰營\"></iframe></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/9c01578c44-s-89505803-0.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/legacy/img/a726182944-s-89505806-0.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/a726182944-s-89505806-0.jpg\" width=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p>工程學院陳明志院長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 吳欽文理事長頒發 EMRD 榮譽會員</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/5074f9a111-s-89513992-0.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/6e2f8ad93f-s-89505811-0.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>EMRD 游進陽執行長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 鄭逸琳副執行長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/09c4109b98-s-89513991-0.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/ab08462db0-s-89513989-0.jpg\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>SEMI-EMRD 邱昱誠執行長致詞&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; EMRD 112 級蔡孟霖班導師致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/1fe7cff3fa-s-89505820-0.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/3082abb8a3-s-89505825-0.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>合照&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 112 級新生</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/a9dc8864a0-s-89505827-0.jpg\" width=\"400\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"300\" src=\"/legacy/img/ee598411a3-s-89505828.jpg\" 